### Supabase REST Data API Test Suite (Milestone Step 3)
### Course: Application Development (CIT-U Computer Studies Department)
### Slide 46 Reference: test.http

@url = https://YOUR-REF.supabase.co
@key = sb_publishable_your_key_here

### 1. Test Fetch All Active Tourist Spots (GET)
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/tourist_spots?deleted_at=is.null&select=*
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### 2. Test Habit 2: Fetch and Filter in Database (Price <= 100 USD)
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/tourist_spots?deleted_at=is.null&base_price_usd=lte.100&select=id,name,base_price_usd,region
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### 3. Test Read Reviews (GET)
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/tourist_reviews?deleted_at=is.null&select=*
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### 4. Test Read Bookings (GET)
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/bookings?deleted_at=is.null&select=*
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
